/S /P
/E (His extensive expertise has earned him numerous appointments to prestigious regulatory and advisory boards, including the Pharmacists Council of Zimbabwe, Health Professions Authority of Zimbabwe, and the Medicines Control Authority of Zimbabwe \(MCAZ\), where he sits on three expert committees. His work in toxicological risk assessment and health-based exposure limits \(HBELs\) has supported the pharmaceutical manufacturing industry across Southern Africa.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
