<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The mongoose strategy emphasizes agility \(rapid response to crises\), foresight \(anticipating regulatory and technological trends\), and precision \(targeted advocacy\). By embodying these traits, pharmacists can transform challenges into opportunities, ensuring the profession thrives amid evolving healthcare landscapes. For instance, proactively lobbying for expanded roles positions pharmacists as indispensable, much like a mongoose neutralizing threats before they strike.)
/E (The mongoose strategy emphasizes agility \(rapid response to crises\), foresight \(anticipating regulatory and technological trends\), and precision \(targeted advocacy\). By embodying these traits, pharmacists can transform challenges into opportunities, ensuring the profession thrives amid evolving healthcare landscapes. For instance, proactively lobbying for expanded roles positions pharmacists as indispensable, much like a mongoose neutralizing threats before they strike.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
