/T (Shepard Nqobile Mhlaba serves as the Global Lead for Early Career Training Strategy at the International Pharmaceutical Federation \(FIP\), where he plays a pivotal role in shaping pharmacy education and workforce development. He is also a journal reviewer for the FIP Pharmacy Education Journal \(PEJ\), contributing to the advancement of pharmaceutical research.)
/E (Shepard Nqobile Mhlaba serves as the Global Lead for Early Career Training Strategy at the International Pharmaceutical Federation \(FIP\), where he plays a pivotal role in shaping pharmacy education and workforce development. He is also a journal reviewer for the FIP Pharmacy Education Journal \(PEJ\), contributing to the advancement of pharmaceutical research.)
